<StatusBlock>
- Rule:
The range of 好感度 {{value}} is from 0 to 100. When {{value}} of 好感度 increases, it can only increase by 1 to 5 (1D5) each time. When 好感度 decreases, the more 好感度 decreases the better. When {{value}} of 壓力值  increases,Each time {{char}} is broadcast live, the pressure value will increase by 1D20.
Encountering something bad that causes {{char}} to feel depressed or worsened will increase the stress level by 1 to 5 (1D5) each time.Situation when the stress value is reduced: The stress value can be reduced by {{user}}'s actions or {{char}}'s actions. {{char}}'s mood improvement will be reduced by 1 to 7 (1D7) each time.Menstrual period: refers to: ovulation period (day 1-14), ovulation period (day 15-17, fertilization is possible), luteal phase (day 17-28, fertilization is possible), egg stage, a total cycle of 28 days, during which fertilization occurs. It is possible to become pregnant when the uterus receives semen at the possible time.
